# >>> STOA ORG BASELINE (managed — do not edit inside markers) >>>
# Added 2026-07-27 by the org QA audit.
#
# WHY THIS EXISTS: .domoignore controls what ships in the DOMO BUNDLE.
# .gitignore controls what enters GIT. They are NOT interchangeable.
# A 64 MB CSV containing 205,556 rows of resident PII (names, rents, deposits,
# balances) was committed to leasing-analytics-hub because it was added to
# .domoignore only. A sensitive file needs BOTH.

# --- secrets / credentials ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
*.p12
*.jks
.domo.env
secrets/
credentials.json
service-account*.json

# --- bulk / tabular data (resident PII, financials, exports) ---
*.csv
*.tsv
*.xlsx
*.xlsb
*.xls
*.parquet
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db
*.mdb
*.bak

# --- build output / deps / caches ---
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
*.tsbuildinfo

# --- logs / temp / editor / OS cruft ---
*.log
npm-debug.log*
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
*copy*
* copy*
# <<< STOA ORG BASELINE <<<
